From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:56:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! logging: structure connection limits and relative
 data-directory startup

Remove terminal per-producer JSON field/type/message conversion assertions. Preserve every preceding real RPC, file, restart, rejection and privacy assertion; remove now-unused schema reader helpers/imports only. No production code or lasting logging framework tests changed. Source syntax/Ruff/diff checks only; functional test NOT_RUN.

Preserved behavior: Relative data-directory startup preserves the isolated chain.
---
 .../feature_logging_connection_startup.py     | 32 +------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_connection_startup.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_connection_startup.py
index eb19e9f36686f3559747912b504e8968daf2e1f6..a6da54c9517e73abf6ba840147d51c9e53d628ad 100644
--- a/test/functional/feature_logging_connection_startup.py
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_connection_startup.py
@@ -2,9 +2,8 @@
